# Color System

This is probably the most difficult decision.

Most leather websites use

```
Brown

Dark Brown

Golden
```

It's predictable.

It immediately looks outdated.

---

## My proposal

### Primary

Deep Charcoal

```
#1B1B1B
```

Almost black.

Luxury.

---

### Secondary

Warm Ivory

```
#F8F5F0
```

Instead of pure white.

Makes leather photography look richer.

---

### Accent

Antique Gold

```
#B68D40
```

Not bright gold.

Very subtle.

Used only for

- Links
- Active menu
- Button hover
- Small highlights

