# Heading Scale

Instead of random sizes.

Use a system.

```
Display

Hero

H1

H2

H3

H4

Body Large

Body

Small

Caption
```

Very consistent.

---

# Spacing System

Never use

```
mt-11px-13mb-17
```

We use a spacing scale.

Example

```
4

8

12

16

24

32

48

64

96

128
```

Everything follows this rhythm.

This is why premium websites feel "balanced."

---

# Border Radius

Again

Don't mix.

Use

```
Cards

20px

Buttons

14px

Inputs

14px

Images

24px

Badges

999px
```

Rounded.

Modern.

Not too round.

